 would  be saved as the fan died of a sudden  heart attack in an eerily similar manner  as to how Kira kills his victims however  it was not Kira who was responsible for  saving Lisa's life but another one of  her fans actually said this fan was not  a human but a Shinigami named jealous  who had been obsessively watching Misa  from the Shinigami realm having fallen  in love with her in saving her life  jealous sacrificed his own due to the  innate roles of Shinigami existence as  their purpose is to take life to extend  their own rather than to extend the life  of others and after being reduced to  dust jealous as Death Note was inherited  by the Shinigami RAM who delivered it to  Misa in the human realm and became her  sort of Shinigami can  in much the same way that Reeve did to  light unlike light Enrico ever Misa and  REM developed an actual relationship  becoming strong friends and greatly  enjoying each other's company Nisa would  speak to REM all the time in Oscar  various questions which REM would answer  as best she could even when it pertained  to sensitive Shinigami information REM  even goes so far as to give me sir  advice and actively help her  unlike Rio who didn't care for light  whatsoever he just wanted to observe and  be entertained with that said as the  series progresses Lisa's relationship  with REM is entirely overshadowed by her  obsession with light to the point where  even after REM comes to sacrifice  herself to save Misa Misa seems pretty  much unaffected by this action instead  simply blinded by her happiness to  continue being with light in any case  we're getting ahead of ourselves  so after learning of the Shinigami realm  and the Death Note Misa was now well  aware of how Kira conducted his killings  and vowed to use her newfound power to  help him and to this end Misa even made  a deal with Bream to obtain Shinigami  eyes which allow they use it to see  people's names and lifespans simply by  looking at them although in order to  make the deal Misa had to give REM half  of her remaining lifespan then in order  to contact here Misa concocts a plan to  send a series of video tapes to the  Sakura TV station in which she claims to  be Kira and even provides evidence to  back it up for example on the first tape  Misa predicts the death of two criminals  and then proceeds to use her Death Note  to kill them at the appointed time  nieces approached during this time also  highlighted the fact that she has filed  a strict about who she kills as opposed  to light at least initially anyway which  was shown when Misa was willing to kill  police officers for the sake of her  goals a factor that immediately tip Dell  off to the idea that they were not  dealing with the original Kira who had  no desire to kill innocence and would  lead to Misa being dubbed the second  Kira with that said mrs. Bhatt worked  out in her favor as she was able to  communicate a coded message to light  resulting in their eventual meeting  during said meeting Lisa fell in love  with light instantly and offered herself  to be used in his endeavor to craft to  utopia and even our slide to make her  his girlfriend to a chair strategically  declined but offered to play the part in  public in order to facilitate the new  partnership of worlds domination this  rejection does not deter me see in the  slightest sir who said that she would  work hard to make light love her and  from here on out light would be niece's  only focus of attention Misa would go on  to confess her love to light multiple  times during series but at no point does  he seem to care for her in the same way  or arguably Bertil despite this Misa  continue to follow light everywhere and  obey every order given to this  Mesa even did the unthinkable and made  the shinigami ideal once more this time  with Rio  after she had lost her initialize having  her lifespan again and effectively  leaving her with only a quarter of the  life she had left remaining but despite  all of